<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill starts CVS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill starts CVS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of CVS Corp as intermediate-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- CVS gained 1-1/4 to 53-1/2.</p>
</text>
